{"lyrics":"[00:09.66](Danny, I See You)\n[00:12.80]Mama know I suffer from addiction\n[00:15.58]Just like my father, she hopin' I was different\n[00:18.60]But I ain't trippin', I know my sins ain't forgiven, uh\n[00:21.46]I ain't Kodak, baby, I got more than tunnel vision\n[00:24.78]Broke up with the drugs, but I think I need them right now\n[00:28.80]Secrets that I can't keep right now\n[00:31.78]Confessions, this a curse and a blessing\n[00:35.36]They say, \"Your word is your weapon,\" oh\n[00:38.18]My grandma probably think that I'm demonic, ha, shit, I am, let's be honest\n[00:44.46]Eyes red when I walk into the crib, ayy, ayy, dilated, what am I on?\n[00:49.90]Uh, mixing pills with the potions, like a present on Christmas, let me open, ayy, ayy\n[00:57.54]Caught me in the open, demons like gangsters, they catch me, they gon' smoke on me\n[01:03.86]Uh-uh-uh, I'm in Hell, I inhale, uh, ayy, how am I? Bitch, I ain't feelin' well\n[01:10.36]Can you tell? Uh, uh, this is not a sad face, I'm having a good day, sarcastic\n[01:16.78]Pops called my phone, I was flabbergasted, 'cause I don't have no pops, I'm a bastard\n[01:23.40]And I don't have no friends, they only come around for a good time, not when it matters\n[01:29.60]Mama know I suffer from addiction\n[01:32.38]Just like my father, she hopin' I was different\n[01:35.42]But I ain't trippin', I know my sins ain't forgiven, uh\n[01:38.56]I ain't Kodak, baby, I got more than tunnel vision\n[01:41.60]Broke up with the drugs, but I think I need them right now\n[01:45.60]Secrets that I can't keep right now\n[01:48.58]Confessions, this a curse and a blessing\n[01:52.24]They say, \"Your word is your weapon,\" oh\n[01:54.98]My homie told me somethin' I can't forget\n[01:58.18]He told me it was hard for us to live, hm\n[02:01.36]See we've been taking Perkys since a kid\n[02:04.38]Now my heart don't work the same like I was turning eighty six, hm\n[02:07.98]Never wanna feel this way again\n[02:10.44]Oxy, Molly, Vicodin and maybe Klonopins, I take it with some Gin, hella Gin\n[02:17.14]Drugs turn a nigga to a skeleton, ayy\n[02:20.76]They used to call us junkies, call us klutz, but look at the way this junkie settin' a trend\n[02:26.96]See I ain't never really give a fuck, I'll take my whole advance and throw it in the wind\n[02:33.22]Ayy, huh, like spend money, uh, throw my life away, uh, spend money\n[02:39.04]Uh, waste my life away, uh, get money, uh, waste money, uh, throw my life away, ayy\n[02:46.40]Mama know I suffer from addiction\n[02:49.18]Just like my father, she hopin' I was different\n[02:52.22]But I ain't trippin', I know my sins ain't forgiven, uh\n[02:55.38]I ain't Kodak, baby, I got more than tunnel vision\n[02:58.40]Broke up with the drugs, but I think I need them right now\n[03:02.40]Secrets that I can't keep right now\n[03:05.38]Confessions, this a curse and a blessing\n[03:08.96]They say, \"Your word is your weapon,\" oh","words":[[9.66,9.98,"(Danny,"],[10.18,10.18,"I"],[10.36,10.7,"See"],[12.62,12.68,"You)"],[12.8,13.06,"Mama"],[13.18,13.34,"know"],[13.5,13.5,"I"],[13.6,13.88,"suffer"],[13.98,14.16,"from"],[14.26,14.76,"addiction"],[15.58,15.74,"Just"],[15.8,15.96,"like"],[16.0,16.1,"my"],[16.18,16.48,"father,"],[16.58,16.66,"she"],[16.82,17.14,"hopin'"],[17.18,17.18,"I"],[17.4,17.5,"was"],[17.6,18.0,"different"],[18.6,18.7,"But"],[18.94,18.94,"I"],[19.0,19.12,"ain't"],[19.16,19.58,"trippin',"],[19.72,19.72,"I"],[19.78,19.9,"know"],[19.98,20.06,"my"],[20.18,20.38,"sins"],[20.46,20.56,"ain't"],[20.6,21.1,"forgiven,"],[21.3,21.34,"uh"],[21.46,21.46,"I"],[21.68,21.9,"ain't"],[21.96,22.3,"Kodak,"],[22.4,22.72,"baby,"],[22.9,22.9,"I"],[22.96,23.08,"got"],[23.18,23.32,"more"],[23.36,23.46,"than"],[23.58,23.86,"tunnel"],[23.98,24.36,"vision"],[24.78,25.02,"Broke"],[25.14,25.16,"up"],[25.2,25.32,"with"],[25.36,25.42,"the"],[25.52,25.92,"drugs,"],[26.0,26.14,"but"],[26.28,26.28,"I"],[26.38,26.54,"think"],[26.68,26.68,"I"],[26.8,27.06,"need"],[27.18,27.4,"them"],[27.58,27.